OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe fire at Kingston upon
OL,4,AThames market
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police is
OL,7,Finvestigating a fire which destroyed a
OL,8,Fnumber of stalls at Kingston's Ancient
OL,9,FMarket in south-west London.
OL,11,FFour fire engines and some 25
OL,12,Ffirefighters were called to the blaze
OL,13,Fon Market Place, Kingston upon Thames,
OL,14,Fin the early hours of Tuesday.
OL,16,FEight people were evacuated and no
OL,17,Finjuries have been reported. The cause
OL,18,Fof the fire, which is currently
OL,19,Funknown, is also under investigation by
OL,20,Fthe London Fire Brigade.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
