OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe fire at Kingston upon
OL,4,AThames market
OL,5,
OL,6,FKingston Council leader Andreas Kirsch
OL,7,Fsaid he was "shocked and saddened" by
OL,8,Fthe fire. He said: "The Ancient Market
OL,9,Fsits at the heart of the community and
OL,10,Fmy thoughts are with the traders,
OL,11,Fbusiness owners and residents who have
OL,12,Fbeen impacted by this incident."
